; The MEMBER route to the non-`bytes` `.cbor` head check — a second arm (`rust_type_from_type1`,
; where the rule-position sibling is in `parse_type`), which is exactly the kind of second route a
; shape refusal has to cover to be a refusal about the SHAPE. It asserted where the rule position
; panicked; both refuse gracefully now, naming the head.
a = [v: uint .cbor uint, x: uint]
